<h1>DaVinci Resolve Keyboard Shortcuts Cheat Sheet 2026 (Free PDF Download)</h1>
<p><strong>Updated for:</strong> DaVinci Resolve 21 | Mac & Windows/Linux modifier keys included</p>

<p>Blackmagic Design doesn't publish a single official up-to-date shortcuts PDF for Resolve 21 — only the in-app Keyboard Customization panel (<kbd>Cmd+Opt+K</kbd> / <kbd>Ctrl+Alt+K</kbd>) and older per-version PDFs. This page compiles the shortcuts that are stable and cross-verified across recent Resolve versions, organized by page, so you can actually memorize them.</p>

